<title>JAPAN: Unisia Jecs - 7-mth group results.</title>
<headline>Unisia Jecs - 7-mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>    (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		    7-mth result		  previous full-year</p>
<p>								result</p>
<p> Sales		127.08		vs	  223.74</p>
<p> Operating	    3.20		vs	    4.59</p>
<p> Current		2.86		vs	    3.51</p>
<p> Net		    1.68		vs	    2.10</p>
<p> EPS		   10.99 yen	  vs	   13.72 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	   nil yen	  vs	     nil yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Unisia Jecs Corp is a car parts maker affiliated</p>
<p>with Nissan Motor Co Ltd. The latest results were</p>
<p>for the seven-month period to September 30, 1996, because</p>
<p>the company changed its business term.</p>
